<title>UK: KLP sets 110 million mark 10-year step-up FRN.</title>
<headline>KLP sets 110 million mark 10-year step-up FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KOMMUNAL LANDESPENSJONSKASSE</p>
<p> AMT    110 MLN DEM   BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY   *12.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     *55 BP    PAY DATE    12.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  100.0     FULL FEES   50 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 100     SALE LIMITS NO/DE/UK/US</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  NORWAY    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO MARCH 2002 THEN STEPS UP TO 130 BP IF NOT CALLED</p>
<p>		AT PAR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
